---
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: Academic and consultant working on sustainable software systems, software architecture, and AI-enabled systems.
---
<section class="hero shell">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Academic · Consultant · Software Architect</p>
    <h1>Building Intelligent Software Systems which are Sustainable by Design.</h1>
    <p class="lede">I work where software architecture, artificial intelligence, and sustainability meet—through research, teaching, and practical collaboration with organizations.</p>
    <div class="button-row">
      <a class="button button-primary" href="/research/">Explore my research</a>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="/consulting/">Discuss consulting</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <aside class="intro-card" aria-label="Current role">
    <img class="profile-image" src="{{ site.profile.small }}" srcset="{{ site.profile.small }} 320w, {{ site.profile.large }} 600w" sizes="(max-width: 48rem) 280px, 320px" width="{{ site.profile.width }}" height="{{ site.profile.height }}" alt="{{ site.profile.alt }}" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high">
    <div class="intro-card-copy">
      <p class="card-kicker">Currently</p>
      <p class="intro-role">Assistant Professor</p>
      <p>Software Engineering Research Center<br>IIIT Hyderabad, India</p>
      <dl class="focus-list">
        <div>
          <dt>Research</dt>
          <dd>Sustainable and AI-enabled software systems</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Practice</dt>
          <dd>Architecting Agentic and Adaptive Systems</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </aside>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="shell metrics" aria-label="Professional profile">
    <div><strong>{{ publications | length }}</strong><span>Publication records</span></div>
    <div><strong>{{ projects | length }}</strong><span>Research and applied projects</span></div>
    <div><strong>A+</strong><span>Estimated website carbon rating</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section shell">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Two connected practices</p>
      <h2>Ideas tested in research. Lessons grounded in practice.</h2>
    </div>
    <p>My academic and consulting work inform each other while serving different outcomes.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="path-grid">
    <article class="path-card path-academic">
      <p class="path-number">01</p>
      <h3>Research & teaching</h3>
      <p>Research, publications, teaching, and student supervision focused on architecting sustainable and AI-enabled systems.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/research/">Explore research <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </article>
    <article class="path-card path-consulting">
      <p class="path-number">02</p>
      <h3>Consulting</h3>
      <p>Architecture reviews, responsible AI strategy, and technical workshops for teams building ML-enabled products and services.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/consulting/">View consulting focus <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section shell section-rule">
  <div class="section-heading compact-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Resources & field notes</p>
      <h2>Writing and ideas worth returning to.</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href="/resources/">Explore the collection <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="project-grid">
    <article class="project-card">
      <p class="project-role">IEEE Software</p>
      <h3>Software Engineering Radio digests</h3>
      <p>Articles connecting expert conversations across software architecture, agentic AI, security, and engineering practice.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/resources/#ieee-software-writing">Read my writing <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </article>
    <article class="project-card">
      <p class="project-role">Essential reading</p>
      <h3>Research that shaped my thinking</h3>
      <p>Annotated papers spanning software architecture, self-adaptation, AI-enabled systems, and sustainable software.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/resources/#essential-reading">Browse the papers <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section shell section-rule">
  <div class="section-heading compact-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Selected projects</p>
      <h2>Research translated into working systems.</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href="/projects/">Explore all projects <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="project-grid project-grid-home">
    {% for project in projects %}
      {% if loop.index <= 3 %}
        <article class="project-card">
          <p class="project-role">{{ project.role }}</p>
          <h3>{{ project.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ project.description }}</p>
          <p class="project-collaboration">{{ project.collaboration }}</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/projects/{{ project.slug }}/">Project details <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section shell section-rule">
  <div class="section-heading compact-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Selected research</p>
      <h2>Recent publications</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href="/publications/">View all publications <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
  <ol class="publication-list publication-list-home">
    {% for publication in publications %}
      {% if loop.index <= 3 %}
        <li>
          <span class="publication-year">{{ publication.year }}</span>
          <div>
            <h3>{% if publication.url %}<a href="{{ publication.url }}">{% endif %}{{ publication.title }}{% if publication.url %}</a>{% endif %}</h3>
            <p>{{ publication.venue }}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="section shell section-rule">
  <div class="section-heading compact-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Updates</p>
      <h2>Recent news</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href="/news/">Browse all news <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
  <ol class="news-list news-list-home">
    {% set recentNews = collections.news | reverse %}
    {% for item in recentNews %}
      {% if loop.index <= 3 %}
        <li>
          <time datetime="{{ item.date | htmlDate }}">{{ item.date | readableDate }}</time>
          <h3><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a></h3>
        </li>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="closing shell">
  <p class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</p>
  <h2>Working on an AI-enabled system that needs better architectural thinking?</h2>
  <a class="button button-primary" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email Karthik</a>
</section>
